-- HEAIL question bank seed — Part 3 of 4 (S11-S15)
-- Run all 4 parts, in order, in the same database.
-- Idempotent: safe to re-run, upserts on primary key.
-- Prerequisite: the `sections` and `question_bank` tables must already exist
-- (created by Hibernate ddl-auto=update the first time the Spring Boot app starts).

BEGIN;

