  ($qb$S11C01Q01$qb$, $qb$S11$qb$, $qb$C01$qb$, $qb$L$qb$, $qb$The senior leadership team in your organisation functions as:$qb$, $qb$A genuine team — shared goals, mutual accountability, and real collaboration on critical decisions$qb$, $qb$A functional group — generally aligned without deep collaboration$qb$, $qb$A set of parallel leaders — each focused on their domain with limited collective leadership$qb$, $qb$A dysfunctional group — leadership team tensions undermine organisational effectiveness$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
