  ($qb$S12C01Q01$qb$, $qb$S12$qb$, $qb$C01$qb$, $qb$L$qb$, $qb$The organisation's digital and technology strategy is:$qb$, $qb$Clearly defined, funded, and aligned to business strategy — technology is a deliberate competitive lever$qb$, $qb$Generally defined — a technology roadmap exists and is broadly followed$qb$, $qb$Vague — technology decisions are made reactively without a long-term strategy$qb$, $qb$Non-existent — technology is treated as a cost to manage rather than a capability to build$qb$, 5, 3, 2, 1, true),
